/// Video Generation Module
///
/// Implements video diffusion models for temporally coherent video synthesis
/// from text descriptions or conditioning images.
///
/// ## Components
///
/// - **types**: Core video types (VideoTensor, FrameSequence, MotionField)
/// - **vae3d**: 3D VAE for spatiotemporal compression
/// - **temporal**: Temporal attention and motion modules
/// - **unet3d**: 3D U-Net for video denoising
/// - **transformer**: Video DiT/transformer architectures
/// - **pipeline**: High-level video generation pipelines
///
/// ## Supported Models
///
/// - Stable Video Diffusion (SVD) - Image-to-video
/// - AnimateDiff - Motion modules for SD
/// - CogVideoX - DiT-based long video
/// - Mochi - High quality video DiT
/// - LTX-Video - Fast inference
///
/// ## Evidentiality Usage
///
/// - `data~`: User prompts, conditioning frames, motion vectors
/// - `computed!`: Generated frames, denoised latents, interpolated video
/// - `found?`: Optional temporal configs, cached motion states

pub mod types
pub mod vae3d
pub mod temporal
pub mod unet3d
pub mod transformer
pub mod pipeline
pub mod enhancement

